  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852274), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14435188)  \n\nHaru is a high school student destined to live a lonely life due to a sin from his past life. Living alone without family or friends, Haru is visited by a suspicious transfer student. Just as the two, both having no friends, are about to grow closer, the transfer student ends up having his secret exposed... Will the two of them be able to become friends?",
